From e77cfe2f60764b38fbb5700064d2775bcebb425a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: moto <j3tm0t0@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 03:26:19 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] away: settings for use outside home from the SD card
 (x68000z/away.txt), chosen at boot when the home SSID is not seen

AWAY: auto|always|off, own Wi-Fi SSID/password (63 chars), other items override the flash settings in RAM. SMB2_SERVER empty: no SMB, SD units ready at once, Wi-Fi retried in the background without remote_sem. WPA2 and WPA2/WPA3 tried in turn for the away Wi-Fi. status shows away=1.
